.SH NAME
\fBmate-mouse-properties \fP- configure MATE mouse preferences
\fB
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.fam C
     \fBmate-mouse-properties\fP [\fB--get-legacy\fP] [\fImate-std-options\fP]

.fam T
.fi
.fam T
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
.B
The
MATE  mouse  preference  tool  enables you to configure your mouse for right-hand or
.TP
.B
left-hand use.
It is also used to specify the speed and sensitivity of mouse movement and
mouse button press events.
.SH OPTIONS
The following options are supported:
.TP
.B
\fB--get-legacy\fP
Retrieve and store legacy settings
.TP
.B
\fImate-std-options\fP
Standard  options  available for use with most MATE applications.
See \fImate-std-options\fP(5).
.SH EXAMPLES
Example 1: Launching the \fBmate-mouse-properties\fP tool
.PP
example% \fBmate-mouse-properties\fP
